In addition to Senator Collins, this bill is cosponsored by Senators Bernie Sanders (I-VT), Bill Cassidy (R-LA), Bob Casey (D-PA), Tim Kaine (D-VA), Markwayne Mullin (R-OK), and Edward Markey (D-MA).

